            "review_title": "Review at Hoa Hoa Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Lam D\nHanoi, Vietnam329 contributions\n0\nYou should go to this restaurant to try seafood\nSep 2026 • Couples\nWereturned here after two years, and everything is still great; the signature jellyfish noodle soup is as delicious as ever. The service is fast and friendly. The seafood is fresh and tasty; prices might be a bit high, but they are justified—you can enjoy excellent seafood for 300,000–400,000 VND. We tried the specialty steamed giant isopod (priced at 1,800,000 VND/kg), which was truly unique and delicious. The owner is very welcoming. This is a long-established seafood spot in Quy Nhon that is well worth a visit. Now they move to new address 02 Bình Hà, Quy Nhơn, Gia Lai\nRead more\nWritten September 1, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
