            "review_text": "Thomashour\nHo Chi Minh 12 contributions\n0\nLive n fresh...\nOct 2015 • Family\nLive and fresh seafood serve hot and delicious, very crowded. Everyone go there because it is recommended widely by everyone. Very cheap compare to other sea boarder cities. Although it's crowded, the food come out quite fast. The downside to this restaurant is its' location, before the harbor entrance. The way to get there is very quite, feel a bit unsafe. The restaurant need a mayor renovation. The way it's built feel like it's unsafe. Overall, the food is great.\nRead more\nWritten October 11, 2015",
